      "proposed_content": "The source translates RH's zero-location statement into several distinct families of witnesses: positivity for all test functions, all Li coefficients, half-plane points, Fourier-kernel parameters, or structured matrix sizes, and approximation or density over expanding function classes. Their common structure is universal or limiting certification in another representation, not a finite list of zero checks.",
